{"title": "Lightly Obscured (Condition)", "pageid": 10402, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions with shared stack IDs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the condition. For an explanation of the entire game mechanic, see <a href=\"/wiki/Obscurity\" title=\"Obscurity\">Obscurity</a>. For items that interact with it, see <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured_set\" title=\"Obscured set\">Obscured set</a>.  </div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Lightly Obscured</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Hiding in a Lightly <a href=\"/wiki/Obscurity\" title=\"Obscurity\">Obscured</a> area. Has to make a <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check when caught. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SNEAKING_LIGHTLY_OBSCURED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SNEAKING_LIGHTLY_OBSCURED+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:SNEAKING_LIGHTLY_OBSCURED+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">OBSCURED</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2COBSCURED%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2COBSCURED%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/DisableOverhead\">DisableOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>OBSCURED</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Clear_Area\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clear Area\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Clear_Area_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Clear_Area_(Condition)\" title=\"Clear Area (Condition)\">Clear Area</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Hiding in an <a href=\"/wiki/Obscurity\" title=\"Obscurity\">unobscured</a> area. Will be caught on sight.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Heavily_Obscured\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heavily Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b8/Heavily_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Heavily_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Heavily Obscured (Condition)\">Heavily Obscured</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Hiding in a Heavily <a href=\"/wiki/Obscurity\" title=\"Obscurity\">Obscured</a> area. Will go undetected unless they get too close to another creature.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Lightly_Obscured\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightly_Obscured_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightly Obscured (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightly Obscured\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Lightly_Obscured_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Lightly Obscured</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Hiding in a Lightly <a href=\"/wiki/Obscurity\" title=\"Obscurity\">Obscured</a> area. Has to make a <a href=\"/wiki/Stealth\" title=\"Stealth\">Stealth</a> check when caught.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Sneaking\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sneaking_(Condition)\" title=\"Sneaking (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sneaking\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Sneaking_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sneaking_(Condition)\" title=\"Sneaking (Condition)\">Sneaking</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Hiding in an unobscured area. Will be caught on sight.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200656\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2092/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24421/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5028/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.031/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1403249/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.588      1 -total\n 98.78%   50.960      1 Template:Condition_page\n 36.48%   18.818      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 20.69%   10.672      6 Template:Icon_link\n 19.51%   10.064      6 Template:Icon_text\n 19.03%    9.816     22 Template:Trim\n 14.41%    7.432      4 Template:Template_style\n 13.98%    7.211      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 12.70%    6.552      4 Template:Condition_inline/format\n  8.39%    4.328      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10402-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200656 and revision id 394632. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}